    acg:hasObservedValue "Build Azure Cosmos DB NoSQL services with Python/FastAPI following production-grade patterns. Use when implementing database client setup with dual auth (DefaultAzureCredential + emulator), service layer classes with CRUD operations, partition key strategies, parameterized queries, or TDD patterns for Cosmos. Triggers on phrases like \"Cosmos DB\", \"NoSQL database\", \"document store\", \"add persistence\", \"database service layer\", or \"Python Cosmos SDK\"." ;
